<title>TURKEY: Bosphorus still closed to all traffic due to fog.</title>
<headline>Bosphorus still closed to all traffic due to fog.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Istanbul's narrow Bosphorus waterway was closed to all sea traffic for a second day on Thursday due to heavy fog over the city, maritime officials said.</p>
<p>They said they did not expect a quick clearing of the fog over the strait, shut since 1945 GMT on Wednesday.</p>
<p>An official said an attempt to reopen commuter lines failed in the morning.</p>
</text>
